. She is recognized for her expertise in the field and has contributed to the medical community through her authorship of articles related to diabetes mellitus.", "DR. FERNANDO L. CALVO GRACIA:Dr. Fernando L. Calvo Gracia is a medical specialist in Endocrinology and Nutrition at Hospital Clínico Universitario Lozano Blesa in Zaragoza. He is particularly involved in managing nutritional support for patients with pancreatic tumors, demonstrating his expertise in both endocrinology and nutrition within a clinical setting.", "DRA. Mª VICTORIA GARCÍA ZAFRA:Dra. Mª Victoria García Zafra is a medical specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital General Universitario Santa Lucía in Cartagena. She is recognized for her work in providing nutritional support, particularly for patients with complex conditions such as MELAS syndrome and diabetes. As an author of one of the clinical cases presented, she emphasizes the importance of tailored nutritional interventions in managing these intricate health issues.", "DRA. MARÍA LUISA FERNÁNDEZ SOTO:Dra. María Luisa Fernández Soto is a highly regarded specialist in Endocrinology and Nutrition. She serves as the scientific director and coordinator of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at Hospital Universitario San Cecilio in Granada. Her expertise in the field is complemented by her leadership role within the hospital, where she oversees the clinical nutrition and dietetics services.", "DRA. ÁNGELA GONZÁLEZ DÍAZ-FAES:Dra. Ángela González Díaz-Faes is a medical professional specializing in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital Universitario Marqués de Valdecilla in Cantabria. She manages nutritional care for patients with diabetes and other related conditions, providing essential nutritional support specifically for diabetic patients suffering from head and neck cancer. Her expertise encompasses a comprehensive approach to nutritional management, ensuring that her patients receive tailored care to address their unique health needs.", "DR. MIGUEL LEÓN SANZ:Dr. Miguel León Sanz is a distinguished medical professional specializing in oncology nutrition and endocrinology. He serves as the head of the endocrinology and nutrition service at Hospital Universitario 12 de Octubre in Madrid. In addition to his clinical responsibilities, Dr. León Sanz is also an author and contributor to the medical field, actively engaging in research and advancements related to nutrition in oncology. His expertise encompasses both the nutritional aspects of cancer care and the broader field of endocrinology.", "DR. FRANCISCO LOSFABLOS CALLAU:Dr. Francisco Losfablos Callau is a medical specialist in endocrinology and nutrition, currently practicing at Hospital Universitario Miguel Servet in Zaragoza. He is recognized for his expertise in the field and has contributed to the medical community as a co-author of articles focused on diabetes mellitus.", "DR. DANIEL A. DE LUIS ROMÁN:Dr. Daniel A. de Luis Román is the scientific director and head of the endocrinology and nutrition service at Hospital Clínico Universitario de Valladolid. In this role, he oversees the department's operations and contributes to advancements in the field of endocrinology and nutrition.", "DRA. ÁNGELA MARTÍN PALMERO:Dra. Ángela Martín Palmero is the head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at Hospital San Pedro in La Rioja. In her role, she emphasizes the management of diabetes and addresses issues related to disease-related malnutrition, ensuring comprehensive care for her patients.", "DR. JUAN FRANCISCO MERINO TORRES:Dr. Juan Francisco Merino Torres is a distinguished medical doctor specializing in endocrinology and nutrition. He serves as the head of the Endocrinology and Nutrition department at Hospital Universitario y Politécnico La Fe in Valencia, where he also holds the position of director científico. Dr. Merino Torres is recognized for his expertise in the field, particularly in relation to diabetes mellitus, and has contributed to the medical community through various published articles on the subject. His leadership at the hospital underscores his commitment to advancing the understanding and treatment of endocrine and nutritional disorders.", "DRA. ROSA Mª MIRETE LÓPEZ:Dra. Rosa Mª Mirete López is a medical specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital Universitario de San Juan in Alicante. She is known for her expertise in treating patients with diabetes mellitus and inflammatory bowel disease, providing specialized care to manage these conditions effectively.", "DRA. MARÍA JOSÉ MOLINA PUERTA:Dra. María José Molina Puerta is a medical specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital Universitario Reina Sofía in Córdoba. She is also an author of a clinical case that discusses the interrelated issues of morbid obesity, diabetes, and bariatric surgery, highlighting her expertise in these critical areas of health.", "DRA. JULIA OCÓN BRETÓN:Dra. Julia Ocón Bretón is a specialist in clinical nutrition and endocrinology at the Hospital Clínico Universitario Lozano Blesa in Zaragoza. She is responsible for the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at this hospital, where she focuses on medical nutritional therapy."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}